@startmindmap quality-tree

' A42-11 — accent-blue family (verified against --lt-accent in
' kotlin-invoice/src/main/frontend/themes/littletrotter/styles.css), same
' tint family as the C4 diagrams (see c4-styling.puml.inc). Root/node/leaf are
' given the intended three-step tint below (root = full accent, node = 85%
' tint, leaf = 55% tint, all dark-text-on-tint pairs checked >=4.5:1 AA) —
' PlantUML 1.2023.12's mindmap renderer only actually honors the `node`
' block here and renders every level with it, so the built diagram currently
' shows one flat accent-blue tone throughout (#3C88EB, still on-palette and
' AA-safe with #202124 text: 4.53:1). Left in place for whenever the pinned
' PlantUML version changes.
skinparam defaultFontName "Roboto, Segoe UI, sans-serif"
skinparam defaultFontSize 12

skinparam mindmapDiagram {
  BackgroundColor #ffffff
  RootBackgroundColor #1A73E8
  RootFontColor #ffffff
  RootFontSize 14
  RootFontStyle bold
}

skinparam node {
  BackgroundColor #3C88EB
  BorderColor #1456AE
  FontColor #202124
  FontSize 12
  FontStyle bold
}

skinparam leafNode {
  BackgroundColor #81B2F2
  BorderColor #2D66B0
  FontColor #202124
  FontSize 11
}

* **Quality**
** **1. Domain correctness**
*** EN 16931 / UStG legal compliance
*** Multi-stage validation: XSD, Schematron, embedded KoSIT validator
*** Money type everywhere; no floating-point amounts
** **2. Test coverage and quality gates**
*** JaCoCo: 90% line / 90% branch bundle gate, every module including the UI
*** Critical components (Money, tax rules) at 100% line and branch
*** Zero-finding linters: ktlint, detekt, sqlfluff
*** Zero-error Qodana static analysis
** **3. Ergonomics**
*** German-language UI, English fallback locale
*** WCAG AA contrast, checked per color/UI change
*** Dark mode parity for every UI surface
** **4. Operability on small hardware**
*** Explicit per-container memory budget (Pi-class target)
*** Restart resilience: no job lost across a container restart
** **5. Traceability**
*** Reconstructable invoice state history (draft/issued/cancelled)
*** Encrypted database and object-storage backups (recovery, not archiving)
** **6. Green IT (lean payload and storage)**
*** Receipts reduced at upload, embedded exactly once per invoice
*** Document size budget per invoice

@endmindmap
